GET {{base}}/api/shows/4/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Rebook S01 after cancellation
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 4,
  "seatNumber": "S01"
}
### Try booking the same seat again
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 4,
  "seatNumber": "S01"
}
